    "subject": "mathematics",
    "topic": "simple_compound_interest",
    "difficulty": 4,
    "question": "A certain sum at simple interest amounts to Rs. 1,008 in 2 years and to Rs. 1,164 in 3.5 years. Find the rate of interest.",
